<title>JAPAN: Oki Electric - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Oki Electric - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		239.74		vs	  257.41</p>
<p> Operating	    9.68		vs	   33.66</p>
<p> Current		7.14		vs	   28.63</p>
